         <t indent="0" pn="section-a.1-3">The following principles have been established to clarify the scope
 of the present DetNet work.</t>
         <ul bare="false" empty="false" indent="3" spacing="normal" pn="section-a.1-4">
-          <li pn="section-a.1-4.1"> The scope of networks addressed by DetNet is limited to networks
